[2026-07-20T15:30:10.947Z] [master 8909d7d37] IBM SVF bug fix for broken SSH execution retry logic. The retry delay was triggered for SSH CLI commands that should not be retried, and the exception handling code prevented retries from occurring when attempts was greater than one. These issues are fixed by adding an additional condition before sleeping and moving the exception handling block outside the retry loop, allowing all configured retry attempts to be exhausted before the final exception is raised.
